# behavior: 3 former lowering declarations cases run in order, each program from its own module: trait_default_appending_its_own_item, trait_default_calls_on_self, trait_default_passes_self_by_value
# expect-stdout:
#  3
#  20
#  x!
#  6
#  hi LABEL
